{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09059","headline":"冬至夜寄京师诸弟兼怀崔都水 · 韦应物","name":"冬至夜寄京师诸弟兼怀崔都水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"理郡无异政，所忧在素飡。\n徒令去京国，羁旅当岁寒。\n子月生一气，阳景极南端。\n已怀时节感，更抱别离酸。\n私燕席云罢，还斋夜方阑。\n邃幕沈空宇，孤灯照牀单。\n应同兹夕念，宁忘故岁欢。\n川途恍悠邈，涕下一阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}